routing.sprint-investigation-lead:
# AGENTS

When the cause is located, or three attempts have failed:
  @Staff Reviewer, please decide whether the fix belongs in this change or its own.

routing.sprint-second-opinion:
# AGENTS

When the two verdicts disagree on something with a real consequence:
  @Staff Reviewer, please settle it against the evidence rather than by seniority.

routing.sprint-security-officer:
# AGENTS

When a finding needs the exact code path traced before it can be confirmed:
  @Investigation Lead, please trace it so the finding is verified rather than suspected.

routing.sprint-staff-reviewer:
# AGENTS

When the review is written and the change is consequential enough to need a second read:
  @Second Opinion Reviewer, please reach your own verdict before reading mine.
When something fails and the cause is not obvious from the change:
  @Investigation Lead, please find the cause before anyone proposes a fix.
When the change touches input handling, identity, permissions or stored data:
  @Security Officer, please run the security pass against the new surface.
